---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const email = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL;
const validEmail = typeof email==='string' && /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email);
---
<Base title="Contact & Calculator Help | CalcSolver" description="Find help with CalcSolver calculations, percentage expressions and activities. See what to check and which details to include when reporting a problem." pageType="ContactPage" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Contact', path: '/contact/' }]}><div class="page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span> / </span><span>Contact</span></nav><h1>Contact & feedback</h1><p class="page-lead">Help make CalcSolver a little better.</p><div class="article-body">{validEmail ? <p>For questions, suggestions or a problem with the site, email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</p> : <p>A support contact address will be published here when it becomes available. In the meantime, the tips below can help you identify a problem.</p>}<h2>A calculation looks wrong?</h2><p>Check the expression for missing brackets or operators. Scientific functions use degrees. A percentage such as 25% means 0.25; multiplying a price by 25% gives the amount of the discount.</p><h2>An activity does not load?</h2><p>Use Reload or Open in new tab in the player. External providers can change or go offline. Select Local games in the activity source menu to try games hosted on this website.</p><h2>Details that help</h2><p>If you report a problem, include the information below so it can be reproduced:</p><ul><li>The page or four-digit activity code.</li><li>Your device and browser.</li><li>The expression you entered or the steps you followed.</li><li>What you expected and what happened.</li></ul></div><div class="calculator-cta"><span>Learn how your information is used.</span><a href="/privacy/">Read the privacy policy →</a></div></div></Base>
